OL,3,AMusk says US government may be behind
OL,4,Aslowdown of Ukraine drone speeds
OL,5,
OL,6,FElon Musk has suggested that the US
OL,7,Fgovernment may be behind restrictions
OL,8,Fon the speed at which some of Ukraine's
OL,9,Fweapons can travel and stay connected
OL,10,Fto SpaceX's Starlink internet network.
OL,12,FStarlink is a vital tool allowing Kyiv
OL,13,Fto guide drones to Russian targets and
OL,14,Falso protect its own skies, but on
OL,15,FTuesday night Ukraine said unexpected
OL,16,Fnew speed limits were disrupting its
OL,17,Fbattlefield missions.
OL,23,APub: 14-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
FL,312,300,200,140,0,100
