OL,3,AMusk says US government may be behind
OL,4,Aslowdown of Ukraine drone speeds
OL,5,
OL,6,FAn adviser to President Volodymyr
OL,7,FZelensky said he believed the
OL,8,Frestrictions were not a coincidence and
OL,9,Fwere related to the latest strains
OL,10,Fbetween Kyiv and Washington.
OL,12,FMusk said that Starshield, the
OL,13,Fmilitary-grade sister service to
OL,14,FStarlink, is controlled by the US
OL,15,Fgovernment, and "any limits on speed or
OL,16,Fusage are decided by the US military
OL,17,Fand ultimately [the US president]".
OL,23,APub: 14-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
